<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>New Mentoring Session Request</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
        .content { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
        .session-details { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #667eea; }
        .button { display: inline-block; background: #28a745; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 5px; }
        .button.decline { background: #dc3545; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎓 New Mentoring Session Request</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong><%= mentorName %></strong>,</p>
            
            <p>You have received a new mentoring session request from <strong><%= studentName %></strong>.</p>
            
            <div class="session-details">
                <h3>📋 Session Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Title:</strong> <%= sessionTitle %></p>
                <p><strong>Category:</strong> <%= sessionCategory %></p>
                <p><strong>Start Time:</strong> <%= startTime %></p>
                <% if (endTime) { %>
                <p><strong>End Time:</strong> <%= endTime %></p>
                <% } %>
                <% if (description) { %>
                <p><strong>Description:</strong> <%= description %></p>
                <% } %>
                <% if (agenda) { %>
                <p><strong>Agenda:</strong> <%= agenda %></p>
                <% } %>
                <p><strong>Student:</strong> <%= studentName %> (<%= studentEmail %>)</p>
            </div>
            
            <p>Please review the session details and confirm your availability:</p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= confirmUrl %>" class="button">✅ Accept Session</a>
                <a href="<%= declineUrl %>" class="button decline">❌ Decline Session</a>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>Important:</strong> Please respond within 24 hours to help the student plan accordingly.</p>
            
            <div class="footer">
                <p>Best regards,<br>SquadCo Hackademy Team</p>
                <p><small>This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this email.</small></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>